# Testing

- Never publish for real to Facebook or Instagram in tests.
- Mock AI and Meta providers; prefer DRY_RUN paths.
- Unit tests live in `tests/unit`; integration in `tests/integration`; e2e in `tests/e2e`.
- A phase is incomplete if its tests fail.
